"/**
 * Open Language Learning Platform — design system.
 *
 * Direction: a calm, warm, editorial learning workspace. Warm paper
 * neutrals, one deep-teal accent, serif display headings over a system
 * sans body with Japanese-capable fallbacks (docs/11: prefer system
 * font stacks; no distributed font files). Hairline borders and flat
